OL,3,ATrump signs sweeping Russia sanctions
OL,4,Abill
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has signed a
OL,7,Fsweeping sanctions bill, taking aim at
OL,8,FRussia's economy by punishing major
OL,9,Fpurchasers of its oil and gas.
OL,11,FThe bill, passed by the US House of
OL,12,FRepresentatives earlier this week,
OL,13,Fgives Trump broad powers to levy
OL,14,Ftariffs of up to 100% on the top five
OL,15,Fpurchasers of Russian oil and gas `
OL,16,Fmost significantly China and India.
OL,18,FAt Trump's behest, the bill also
OL,19,Fextends to Iran's energy and weapons
OL,20,Fsectors.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
